Search the vault for memories about: {{query}}

1. Call ask_vault with query="{{query}}" first — this returns the most relevant paragraphs
   directly, scored by semantic similarity. Discard excerpts with score < 0.4.
2. If ask_vault results are thin, call search_memories with query="{{query}}" to find
   the best matching full memories by title.
3. For the top result, call get_memory_context to get its full body and 1-hop neighbours.
4. Summarise your findings and suggest related memories to explore.
